  "published": "2026-11-27T08:31:03.52Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## What's Changed\n### V6.5.2.1:\n\n* Regenerate README detection lists and automate future updates by @totpero in https://github.com/totpero/DeviceDetector.NET/pull/104\n* fix: reuse the compiled regex cache for Match by @patrikwlund in https://github.com/totpero/DeviceDetector.NET/pull/105\n* Sync with upstream PHP device-detector master (6.5.2-42) by @totpero in https://github.com/totpero/DeviceDetector.NET/pull/108\n* Fix the build after the NuGet updates, add .NET 11 and a .slnx solution by @totpero in https://github.com/totpero/DeviceDetector.NET/pull/110\n* Run the tests in GitHub Actions and remove AppVeyor by @totpero in https://github.com/totpero/DeviceDetector.NET/pull/112\n* Fix the web tool root page and add a page with the detected icons by @totpero in https://github.com/totpero/DeviceDetector.NET/pull/114\n\n## Improves detection:\n* Improves detection for iPadOS\n* Improves detection for Avast Secure Browser\n* Adds detection for Amazon Prime Video and improves detection for Facebook\n* Adds detection for Android Go\n* Improves version detection for iOS, iPadOS, macOS and tvOS\n* Adds detection for Vega OS\n* Improves version detection for Fire OS\n* Adds detection for Microsoft Surface Pro 7\n* Improves version detection for PlayStation\n* improve detection of Surface Pro, Mi 10T Pro 5G, VALE V10E LTE, add detection for devices of brands Samsung, Blackview, HMD, Google, Lenovo, Xiaomi, OnePlus, Meizu and Biegedy\n* Improves version detection for Windows\n* Improves version detection for webOS\n* Adds detection for iTop Private Browser, Island. MySudo, PrivateBrowsing and SafeBrowser browsers\n* Adds detection for Arrow, Clikon, Coles, ELCO, ioplee and improves detection for Akai, AWOX, Dyon, Edenwood, Essentielb, Hisense\n* Improves version detection for Android\n* Adds detection for Quiche Browser\n* Adds detection for KoboOS and Kobo brand\n* Adds detection for ThinOS and Citrix apps and improves detection for Dell\n* Improves version detection for Android\n* Improves detection for AfriOne and Huawei\n* Adds detection for various bots\n* Improves version and engine version detection from client hints\n* Detect exist brands Tecno Mobile and Vivo\n* Improves detection for Apple devices\n* Improves detection for Lineage OS and Nintendo\n* Detect new brand Rokid: Station (RES102)\n* Detect new brands: Bulsatcom, Yutmart and Detect devices for exists brands\n* Adds detection for various tv brands\n* Improves detection for Hisense\n* Improves detection for VIDAA\n* Adds detection for various tv brands\n* Detect devices for exists brands\n* Adds detection for various tv brands\n* Fix MAUI / MRE Regexe\n* Detect Google-GeminiNotebook and retain Google-NotebookLM\n* Improves detection for Nokia, Puffin OS and Puffin Cloud Browser\n* Improves version detection for iOS, iPadOS and macOS\n* Adds detection for Grok, QuickBooks, Yandex AI\n* Improves regexes\n* Adds detection for various bots\n* Adds detection for Lightpanda and Improves detection for UC Browser\n* Tighten up an iOS regex introduced in #8263, add test fixtures\n* Detect new brand Hoobart and Detect devices for exists brands\n* Improves detection for Honor devices\n* Adds detection for Sun King, Telstra and improves detection for Honor, M-KOPA, Nubia, POCO, Realme, Vivo, Xiaomi, ZTE devices\n* Improves detection for os client hints mapping\n* Improves detection for NIKAI, ONVO and simfer\n* Improves detection for Chrome Webview, HONOR, Startpage and Yandex browsers\n* Adds detection for HyperOS and improves version detection for GO Browser\n* Improves detection for Lineage OS, Mocor OS and Nintendo\n* Add link Go port\n* Adds detection for various apps\n* Add client hints tests for platforms\n* Adds detection for boohee, JOKERBET apps\n* Adds detection for Honor X7e\n* Adds detection for MyOS\n* Improves detection for ChatGPT Atlas, Norton Private Browser and adds detection for nscurl\n* Adds detection for 360 Speed Browser, Mullvad Browser, Stadium, Teak Browser and improves detection for various browsers\n* Improves version detection for iOS and macOS\n* Adds detection for FortiOS\n* Improves detection for Alcatel, Dany, Realme, TCL and ZTE\n* Adds detection for various bots\n* Adds detection for SteamOS, Valve Corporation and improves detection for Steam In-Game Overlay\n* Improves detection for LG QNED televisions\n* Improves brand/model detection from client hints for devices using Avast Secure Browser\n* Improves detection for Apple Watch\n* Adds detection for various brands and improves detection for existing ones\n* Add Google xrawler detection as Search bot\n* Detect devices for exitst brands\n* Improves detection for Apple and macOS\n* Detect devices for exist brands\n* Fixed false-positive Mobile Safari detection for AppleCoreMedia/1.0.0…\n* Adds detection for YaOS and YodaOS-Master\n* Fixed false-positive SerenityOS detection for Ladybird browser\n* Adds eight webOS television brands to the mobile parser\n* Adds brand detection for eight webOS televisions\n* Add The Podcast App (Magnolia) mobile app detection\n* Add ocaml-cohttp library detection\n* add detection of Roboform on Android\n* add additional Regex for Dogtorance App\n* Adds detection for various apps\n* Adds detection for Kaicom and improves detection for other brands\n* add Swisscows Private Search\n* Improve regexes\n\n\t\t**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/totpero/DeviceDetector.NET/compare/v6.5.2...v6.5.2.1",
